{"id":"carretera","lemma":"carretera","pos":"noun","rank":1235,"glosses":["road, highway"],"ipa":"/kareˈteɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"carreteras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-carretera.wav","examples":[{"text":"La carretera estaba congelada.","en":"The road was icy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443646"},{"text":"Varias carreteras permanecen cerradas.","en":"Many highways remain closed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684680"},{"text":"La carretera sigue mojada.","en":"The road is still wet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/802785"},{"text":"Esto es un mapa de carreteras.","en":"This is a road map.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501364"},{"text":"Caminamos por la carretera.","en":"We walked along the road.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/607938"}]}